-- coa30-sch11a.l4: Schedule 11A (Specified persons, descriptions, disclosures etc for the purposes of section 1224A),
-- lines 20521-20653 of ukpga-2006-46.txt (coa30's ranges). Generated by work/gen_sch11a.py; quote lines are copied from the raw
-- file by work/build.py.
--
-- THE SHAPE. Parts 1 and 2 are lists: Part 1 names persons, Part 2 describes disclosures, each by a numbered paragraph.
-- Each paragraph (or lettered limb of a paragraph) is one constructor of an enumerated type, and one lookup function
-- answers JUST TRUE for every constructor. The person in the seat chooses the paragraph that matches their disclosure.
-- A purpose or recipient that no paragraph names is the last constructor of each type, and answers NOTHING: the
-- Schedule lists without closing the list in its own words (section 1224A, coa26, is where the restriction and its
-- exceptions are stated; the Schedule 11A fork in NOTES.md). The paragraphs that are blank in this text (39(b) and (c), 40, 53, 64) have no
-- constructor.

